# Shared across every service (car-magnitude, return-forecast,
# portfolio-allocation) -- copy this file to <repo root>/.env, NOT here.
# Each service loads that one file via cse_lib.env.load_shared_env().
#
# Session token for cse.lk, needed only for /api/charts (daily price history,
# used to compute live volatility_10d). tradeSummary/companyInfoSummery
# (company list, current price) work without this.
#
# How to get it:
#   1. Log into https://www.cse.lk in a normal browser (with your CSE account).
#   2. Open DevTools -> Application tab -> Cookies -> https://www.cse.lk
#   3. Copy the value of the `accessToken` cookie.
#   4. Paste it below and restart the backend.
#
# This expires (typically within hours) -- when /predict or the company
# snapshot endpoint starts returning a "session token has expired" error,
# repeat the steps above and paste a fresh value in.
CSE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
